(3000884, 422314, 60614, '<td valign="top">I can relate to the clowning aroun with photoshop.  I am still learning it. I love the composition of the photo but I am not too keen on the low contrast.  I feel it takes away from such a nice photo.  I think if you went with high contrast it would make this portrait pop.  Just my opinion.  This still is a very nice self portrait.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I can relate to the clowning aroun with photoshop.  I am still learning it. I love the composition of the photo but I am not too keen on the low contrast.  I feel it takes away from such a nice photo.  I think if you went with high contrast it would make this portrait pop.  Just my opinion.  This still is a very nice self portrait.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-05 08:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
