(3001233, 422280, 46177, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, I love the crop and your eye just pops out at me, a favorite in this challenge for me.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, I love the crop and your eye just pops out at me, a favorite in this challenge for me.', '2006-11-05 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3001235, 422512, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great photograph.  For me it has a very retro feeling to it.  I suppose it''s the noise, which very satisfyingly matches film grain in my opinion, but there''s something more about it, something that is very evocative for me.  I love the sparseness, the huge block of sky, the tritone feel, and the very challenge-brave addition of high noise.  Great work, 8.</td>', 'Wow, what a great photograph.  For me it has a very retro feeling to it.  I suppose it''s the noise, which very satisfyingly matches film grain in my opinion, but there''s something more about it, something that is very evocative for me.  I love the sparseness, the huge block of sky, the tritone feel, and the very challenge-brave addition of high noise.  Great work, 8.', '2006-11-05 10:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3001236, 422320, 46177, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, love the pose and lighting, the expression on your face is perfect. Very well done!</td>', 'Great portrait, love the pose and lighting, the expression on your face is perfect. Very well done!', '2006-11-05 10:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
