(3001377, 422368, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like the grain in the image as it fits well with the idea of a weatherbeaten man. The lighting is uneven across the face. At first that bugged me, but after really studying the image it isn''t so much the uneven lighting as it is the shadow it creates of the arm of your glasses under your eye. The shadow from your nose creates a sharp point that may be a bit harsh too. Other than that you have done a very nice job.</td>', 'I really like the grain in the image as it fits well with the idea of a weatherbeaten man. The lighting is uneven across the face. At first that bugged me, but after really studying the image it isn''t so much the uneven lighting as it is the shadow it creates of the arm of your glasses under your eye. The shadow from your nose creates a sharp point that may be a bit harsh too. Other than that you have done a very nice job.', '2006-11-05 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
