(3002178, 422680, 64928, '<td valign="top">Woo! So much anger.  I don''t know if it''s really, but the eyes look as angry as the sign, so I guess that makes the photo successful. The side of the face next to the sign seems a little overexposed, making it almost blend in with the sign.</td>', 'Woo! So much anger.  I don''t know if it''s really, but the eyes look as angry as the sign, so I guess that makes the photo successful. The side of the face next to the sign seems a little overexposed, making it almost blend in with the sign.', '2006-11-05 15:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002183, 422320, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great job!!   The composition is awesome!  The lighting is very good. . .and ummmm. . . .the face is <i>very</i> handsome!  :)   9</td>', 'Great job!!   The composition is awesome!  The lighting is very good. . .and ummmm. . . .the face is very handsome!  :)   9', '2006-11-05 15:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
