(3002393, 422512, 3746, '<td valign="top">nope, this really doesnt work well at all..<br/> <br/>Over-the-top filtered images don''t generally tend to do very well on DPChallenge, and I personally dont go mad for them unless <br/> <br/>1. they are tastefully done.<br/>2. The filter benefits the photos and isnt there just for the sake of it.<br/> <br/> <br/>please dont think I am being negative.. When I give a low score I generally like to leave a `constructive` comment to aid the photographer in future challenges.   -  2 (sorry)</td>', 'nope, this really doesnt work well at all.. Over-the-top filtered images don''t generally tend to do very well on DPChallenge, and I personally dont go mad for them unless  1. they are tastefully done.2. The filter benefits the photos and isnt there just for the sake of it.  please dont think I am being negative.. When I give a low score I generally like to leave a `constructive` comment to aid the photographer in future challenges.   -  2 (sorry)', '2006-11-05 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
