(3002399, 422335, 3746, '<td valign="top">(I like to leave a comment for images I score low to benefit the photographer).<br/> <br/>Hi, none too impressed with this entry. The over-sxposure/over-filtering of this image has killed it. Unless I feel the use of a filter benefits the image then I generally dont go too mad for them.<br/> <br/>Here there is no detail in the image, granted this would work incredibly well for an illustration, but sadly we are not here to vote on drawings.<br/> <br/>Suggestions..  chill out on the photoshop filtering/over contrasting in future, unless you think an image REALLY needs it then dont use it.. Less is most defintely more.<br/> <br/>2  (sorry)</td>', '(I like to leave a comment for images I score low to benefit the photographer). Hi, none too impressed with this entry. The over-sxposure/over-filtering of this image has killed it. Unless I feel the use of a filter benefits the image then I generally dont go too mad for them. Here there is no detail in the image, granted this would work incredibly well for an illustration, but sadly we are not here to vote on drawings. Suggestions..  chill out on the photoshop filtering/over contrasting in future, unless you think an image REALLY needs it then dont use it.. Less is most defintely more. 2  (sorry)', '2006-11-05 16:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
