(3002854, 422676, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love your portraits and this is no exception.  The lighting is perfect, perfect, perfect.  And the shirt adds a bit of extra interest as well.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'I love your portraits and this is no exception.  The lighting is perfect, perfect, perfect.  And the shirt adds a bit of extra interest as well.  Beautifully done.', '2006-11-05 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
