(3002886, 422710, 10818, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I would have cut off a bit on the top, almost down to the hair.  Interesting self portrait, super originality.</td>', 'Cool shot, I would have cut off a bit on the top, almost down to the hair.  Interesting self portrait, super originality.', '2006-11-05 17:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002887, 422435, 30982, '<td valign="top">This I like alot.  I like the pose and the position in the frame, and how the angle is echoed by the trees behind.  Nice strong jawline and warm eyes give clues to the person, too.  Very nice work with this!</td>', 'This I like alot.  I like the pose and the position in the frame, and how the angle is echoed by the trees behind.  Nice strong jawline and warm eyes give clues to the person, too.  Very nice work with this!', '2006-11-05 17:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002893, 422405, 30982, '<td valign="top">What strikes me about this is the balance - you seem to be well placed and fit in well with this scene, which leads me to believe this suits you.  Even the white of your hair is echoed in the scene.  Lovely place and a portrait that seems to portray you well, even without a face.</td>', 'What strikes me about this is the balance - you seem to be well placed and fit in well with this scene, which leads me to believe this suits you.  Even the white of your hair is echoed in the scene.  Lovely place and a portrait that seems to portray you well, even without a face.', '2006-11-05 17:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
