(3003263, 422551, 58247, '<td valign="top">This would be a pretty good shot but for a few things. Mainly the string/pet hair/lint, or whatever it is on your shirt is very distracting. Instead of focusing my attention on your eyes, I immediately start to think, "There sure is alot of stuff on her shirt". Next time take a second and run a lint roller over the shirt if you think about it. However, if you are like me, you don''t usually think about that at first. No problem. This is a member challenge with Advanced Editing, so next time just clone the stuff out. <br/> <br/>Second, I find the image to be a little flat. By flat I mean a lack of contrast. (some people use terminology differently so I want you to know for sure how I am using "flat")This is really more of a personal opinion. I tend to like higher contrast so for me this photo would benefit from a contrast boost.<br/> <br/>Those few things make me score you kind of low, but other than those things it is a nice photo. :-)</td>', 'This would be a pretty good shot but for a few things. Mainly the string/pet hair/lint, or whatever it is on your shirt is very distracting. Instead of focusing my attention on your eyes, I immediately start to think, "There sure is alot of stuff on her shirt". Next time take a second and run a lint roller over the shirt if you think about it. However, if you are like me, you don''t usually think about that at first. No problem. This is a member challenge with Advanced Editing, so next time just clone the stuff out.  Second, I find the image to be a little flat. By flat I mean a lack of contrast. (some people use terminology differently so I want you to know for sure how I am using "flat")This is really more of a personal opinion. I tend to like higher contrast so for me this photo would benefit from a contrast boost. Those few things make me score you kind of low, but other than those things it is a nice photo. :-)', '2006-11-05 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
