(3005065, 422668, 6349, '<td valign="top">I find you so unbelievably attractive.  I think it''s something to do with the shape of your face.  Always like looking at you.  Sorry life isn''t making you smile.  This is great classic photography with no ps gimmicks.  One of the best in the challenge in my opinion. 9</td>', 'I find you so unbelievably attractive.  I think it''s something to do with the shape of your face.  Always like looking at you.  Sorry life isn''t making you smile.  This is great classic photography with no ps gimmicks.  One of the best in the challenge in my opinion. 9', '2006-11-06 06:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
