(3005087, 422390, 6349, '<td valign="top">lime is all the rage in fashion this fall season.  that and pink.  but i prefer green.  nice shot.  well done control of the white blowout background</td>', 'lime is all the rage in fashion this fall season.  that and pink.  but i prefer green.  nice shot.  well done control of the white blowout background', '2006-11-06 06:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
