(3005091, 422634, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this and there are things about it that bother me but those are actually what makes it interesting and unlike other photos like it.  The fact that you are looking out of the frame and the choice of keeping the pale red in the background stripe all break rules to what i think is a good effect.</td>', 'I like this and there are things about it that bother me but those are actually what makes it interesting and unlike other photos like it.  The fact that you are looking out of the frame and the choice of keeping the pale red in the background stripe all break rules to what i think is a good effect.', '2006-11-06 06:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
