(3005096, 422281, 6349, '<td valign="top">Trying to take candids of yourself is hard but I find this attempt very interesting to think about.  It is successful in that I would never think it was a self portrait if it wasn''t in this challenge.</td>', 'Trying to take candids of yourself is hard but I find this attempt very interesting to think about.  It is successful in that I would never think it was a self portrait if it wasn''t in this challenge.', '2006-11-06 06:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
