(3005451, 422658, 53316, '<td valign="top">Kinda freaky, in a good way. Very interesting.</td>', 'Kinda freaky, in a good way. Very interesting.', '2006-11-06 09:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005459, 422504, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I might have prefered no clothing straps, since those vertical lines contrast with the horizontal/diagonal lines, but other than that this is perfect.  The gaze is very powerful and I love how the lines frame the eyes without cutting through them.</td>', 'Beautiful! I might have prefered no clothing straps, since those vertical lines contrast with the horizontal/diagonal lines, but other than that this is perfect.  The gaze is very powerful and I love how the lines frame the eyes without cutting through them.', '2006-11-06 09:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005464, 422734, 53316, '<td valign="top">You make needing bifocals look hot!  I think this is a beautiful photo.</td>', 'You make needing bifocals look hot!  I think this is a beautiful photo.', '2006-11-06 09:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005465, 422486, 28261, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge Superbly, however there are glaring issues here, specifically blown highlights in the windows, harsh reflections in the screen and the screen''s image is also way blown out.  There is less subject overall than overexposed area.<br/> <br/>A faster shutter speed for this image and/or a smaller F-stop would greatly reduce these problems.  Your hand appears blurred, due to slow shutter (everything else is in focus).  Unfortunately, a somewhat boring image.<br/> <br/>Score: 2</td>', 'Meets Challenge Superbly, however there are glaring issues here, specifically blown highlights in the windows, harsh reflections in the screen and the screen''s image is also way blown out.  There is less subject overall than overexposed area. A faster shutter speed for this image and/or a smaller F-stop would greatly reduce these problems.  Your hand appears blurred, due to slow shutter (everything else is in focus).  Unfortunately, a somewhat boring image. Score: 2', '2006-11-06 09:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005468, 422606, 66833, '<td valign="top">40..*sigh*.. I''m there with you in a few short months. Nice photo, I love that you chose a very natural look..Happy Birthday!</td>', '40..*sigh*.. I''m there with you in a few short months. Nice photo, I love that you chose a very natural look..Happy Birthday!', '2006-11-06 09:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005469, 422347, 66833, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s creepy cool..</td>', 'Wow, that''s creepy cool..', '2006-11-06 09:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005477, 422708, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ahhh! FREAKY!! <br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Ahhh! FREAKY!! Very well done.', '2006-11-06 09:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005482, 422515, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very effective. The first thing my eye was drawn to was the needle, but it did not take much at all to see the "self-portraitness" of the photo.</td>', 'Very effective. The first thing my eye was drawn to was the needle, but it did not take much at all to see the "self-portraitness" of the photo.', '2006-11-06 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005489, 422294, 28261, '<td valign="top">The dark room with a person staring at the monitor is unfortunately very overdone.  To achieve an impact, the image should be very unique, with a quality of light and shadow that add extreme interest.  This image comes off like a 2 minute setup, with not much thought to the overall exposure or subject matter.<br/> <br/>Focus is great and the screen exposure is good, but the real subject is lost to the darkness.<br/> <br/>While it meets the challenge, the image is not interesting.  Question:  would you print this and place it in a photo album? <br/> <br/>Score: 2</td>', 'The dark room with a person staring at the monitor is unfortunately very overdone.  To achieve an impact, the image should be very unique, with a quality of light and shadow that add extreme interest.  This image comes off like a 2 minute setup, with not much thought to the overall exposure or subject matter. Focus is great and the screen exposure is good, but the real subject is lost to the darkness. While it meets the challenge, the image is not interesting.  Question:  would you print this and place it in a photo album?  Score: 2', '2006-11-06 09:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
