(3005744, 422175, 28261, '<td valign="top">Sorry, way too dark.  The computer and half lit face motif is quite overrated and tends to be very uninteresting if not pulled off with a very unique concept.  This unfortunately looks like an image that was produced, just to be able to put something in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Score: 2</td>', 'Sorry, way too dark.  The computer and half lit face motif is quite overrated and tends to be very uninteresting if not pulled off with a very unique concept.  This unfortunately looks like an image that was produced, just to be able to put something in the challenge. Score: 2', '2006-11-06 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
