(3006368, 422313, 58610, '<td valign="top">That''s a great way to wake up! The desat de-emphasises what the photo is about; you. Not sure I like that, but it''s interesting. Good editing.</td>', 'That''s a great way to wake up! The desat de-emphasises what the photo is about; you. Not sure I like that, but it''s interesting. Good editing.', '2006-11-06 13:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
