(3008989, 422571, 22734, '<td valign="top">I like this study because of its solid tonal rendition and good exposure. The glace and expression fit the title very well. To have made this perfect I would have brought the right hand just over a bit and positioned it so as to eliminate the 9th zone blow outs in the fingers. This is minor and may not even be noticed by most viewers. Regardless, you get a 7 on first pass for a wonderful portrayal.</td>', 'I like this study because of its solid tonal rendition and good exposure. The glace and expression fit the title very well. To have made this perfect I would have brought the right hand just over a bit and positioned it so as to eliminate the 9th zone blow outs in the fingers. This is minor and may not even be noticed by most viewers. Regardless, you get a 7 on first pass for a wonderful portrayal.', '2006-11-07 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
