(3010589, 422322, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love many of your photos, but I can''t help but feel like you''re coasting with this one. You know, do something weird, process it the usual way, voila! instant masterpiece. I''ll give you a 7 because this is still interesting and well-done, but be sure to recharge your battery because you''ve got a terrific engine.</td>', 'I love many of your photos, but I can''t help but feel like you''re coasting with this one. You know, do something weird, process it the usual way, voila! instant masterpiece. I''ll give you a 7 because this is still interesting and well-done, but be sure to recharge your battery because you''ve got a terrific engine.', '2006-11-07 14:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
