(3012018, 422322, 50034, '<td valign="top"><i>...And two very GREEN eyes with a "Valley Expression".  She wondered what she was going to do with her life because she still couldn''t think of one talent she possessed, and...then...It "hit her" (regulation gloves only, of course), every time she visited her Grand in Chicago she began to make music.  She didn''t understand at first, but once when she scratched the inside of her ear, the music stopped.  When she pulled out her finger, amazingly the music started again.  This great discovery made her realize something else...She could be itchy and She could be musical...Just not at the same time.</i>  :}   Please assured that I have given you a wonderful first paragraph about the character you created, not you personally.  Great Photo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-12 18:58:21.</i></td>', '...And two very GREEN eyes with a "Valley Expression".  She wondered what she was going to do with her life because she still couldn''t think of one talent she possessed, and...then...It "hit her" (regulation gloves only, of course), every time she visited her Grand in Chicago she began to make music.  She didn''t understand at first, but once when she scratched the inside of her ear, the music stopped.  When she pulled out her finger, amazingly the music started again.  This great discovery made her realize something else...She could be itchy and She could be musical...Just not at the same time.  :}   Please assured that I have given you a wonderful first paragraph about the character you created, not you personally.  Great Photo!', '2006-11-07 22:09:14.000000', '2006-11-12 18:58:21.000000', 1),
