(3014717, 422397, 67537, '<td valign="top">I really think you can tell a lot about someone from what you see in their eyes. I like this photo, and your title, however, I think the lighting should have been done a little different (just my opinion). I would have liked to see this photo with the shadow above your right eye, either gone or covering everything but your eyes. It kind of distracts me from what the main focus is, which is your eyes. I also would have liked to see a little more of your left eye. I mean, everyone is  going to have their own opinions or feelings about photos, so stick to what your feeling is. Overall, I like this photo though!</td>', 'I really think you can tell a lot about someone from what you see in their eyes. I like this photo, and your title, however, I think the lighting should have been done a little different (just my opinion). I would have liked to see this photo with the shadow above your right eye, either gone or covering everything but your eyes. It kind of distracts me from what the main focus is, which is your eyes. I also would have liked to see a little more of your left eye. I mean, everyone is  going to have their own opinions or feelings about photos, so stick to what your feeling is. Overall, I like this photo though!', '2006-11-08 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014723, 422494, 67537, '<td valign="top">I really like the intensity of this photo. The only thing I would like to see different, would be to tighten the crop a little, so there is less of your chest shown...and the white border gone. Overall, very nice photo!</td>', 'I really like the intensity of this photo. The only thing I would like to see different, would be to tighten the crop a little, so there is less of your chest shown...and the white border gone. Overall, very nice photo!', '2006-11-08 14:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
