(3015374, 422582, 50982, '<td valign="top">That light needs to find it''s way under the hat a bit more. Otherwise this is a wicked awesome portrait. Sharp as hell and great contrasty black and white. Shoulda saved it for that challenge. Or maybe you did! LOL</td>', 'That light needs to find it''s way under the hat a bit more. Otherwise this is a wicked awesome portrait. Sharp as hell and great contrasty black and white. Shoulda saved it for that challenge. Or maybe you did! LOL', '2006-11-08 16:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
