(3016459, 422514, 11843, '<td valign="top">Lighting is just a touch harsh, imo. Great colors and composition. I''m thinking that I''d prefer it if you had been looking right at me. Still one great shot.</td>', 'Lighting is just a touch harsh, imo. Great colors and composition. I''m thinking that I''d prefer it if you had been looking right at me. Still one great shot.', '2006-11-08 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3016465, 422485, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very study with a frank and outright look. The lighting suits the facial mood. There is only one minor change that I would make. I would simply clone the cathlight from the right eye into the left and presto, a stronger image. Regardless, it is a good capture. Bump.</td>', 'A very study with a frank and outright look. The lighting suits the facial mood. There is only one minor change that I would make. I would simply clone the cathlight from the right eye into the left and presto, a stronger image. Regardless, it is a good capture. Bump.', '2006-11-08 23:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3016468, 422595, 22734, '<td valign="top">Like a self portarit in a small room where one can not get far enough. LOL I believe DPC voters will complaint that they want to see more. However, I do appreciate the presentation as is. Bump.</td>', 'Like a self portarit in a small room where one can not get far enough. LOL I believe DPC voters will complaint that they want to see more. However, I do appreciate the presentation as is. Bump.', '2006-11-08 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3016474, 422635, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humor and interesting d.e. capture, but I can not even begin to guess the author. Whatever, you seem very happy taking pictures and who would spot you? lol Bump.</td>', 'Good sense of humor and interesting d.e. capture, but I can not even begin to guess the author. Whatever, you seem very happy taking pictures and who would spot you? lol Bump.', '2006-11-08 23:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
