(3016484, 422210, 22734, '<td valign="top">A straigthforward character portayal of a determined young man as evidenced by the fixed gaze and the lightly curled down corner of the lips. Good focus and spanking clean lighting. Bump.</td>', 'A straigthforward character portayal of a determined young man as evidenced by the fixed gaze and the lightly curled down corner of the lips. Good focus and spanking clean lighting. Bump.', '2006-11-08 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
