(3022908, 422456, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this.  It''s simple and understated with it''s lack of color except for the splash of green.  I like the expanse of concrete which would normally give off a cold feeling but in contrast here, the photo is quite warm and inviting.  This is even with your closed off positioning far in the back with eyes covered.  My only nitpick is the bit of elbow cropped out, not sure if I like that or not.  But regardless, I like this. :-)</td>', 'I really, really like this.  It''s simple and understated with it''s lack of color except for the splash of green.  I like the expanse of concrete which would normally give off a cold feeling but in contrast here, the photo is quite warm and inviting.  This is even with your closed off positioning far in the back with eyes covered.  My only nitpick is the bit of elbow cropped out, not sure if I like that or not.  But regardless, I like this. :-)', '2006-11-11 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
