(3023083, 422691, 52336, '<td valign="top">I scored it a 5... I think Cindi''s right, the focus is the issue with this.  I think overall it''s a tad dark, though it could be argued that the underexposed elements match the subject, but I would still enhance your figure with curves or what have you to make you pop out a bit more.  Composition is good, as with many of your photos, so you indeed have the "eye".  It''s likely the technicals and the post work that you could concentrate on.</td>', 'I scored it a 5... I think Cindi''s right, the focus is the issue with this.  I think overall it''s a tad dark, though it could be argued that the underexposed elements match the subject, but I would still enhance your figure with curves or what have you to make you pop out a bit more.  Composition is good, as with many of your photos, so you indeed have the "eye".  It''s likely the technicals and the post work that you could concentrate on.', '2006-11-12 00:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
