(3023158, 422390, 24454, '<td valign="top">I still think this is one of your best portraits ever!  Those soft pastels -- great for you!  :)<br/> <br/>I really think this should be on the front page -- right under the one of you in curlers and no make-up :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I still think this is one of your best portraits ever!  Those soft pastels -- great for you!  :) I really think this should be on the front page -- right under the one of you in curlers and no make-up :) ', '2006-11-12 01:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3023159, 422544, 45003, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow!  I always thought you were a true genius -- but hearing how you pulled this off and what you went through -- even more so!<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I second that. Thought it would score higher.</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Wow!  I always thought you were a true genius -- but hearing how you pulled this off and what you went through -- even more so!  I second that. Thought it would score higher.', '2006-11-12 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3023163, 422397, 56873, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments.  This was my first entry ever so I am very pleased with the rating.  There were several reasons, both creative and technical, for the somewhat unconvential crop and after several revision settled on this one.  I knew this would get mixed reactions but I''m glad some people liked it.  I would have like to make some changes to the lighting and positioning of my face but unfortunately I couldn''t devote all day to this image so I had to go with the best one I had at the time.  My setup was rather crude which made attempting to make fine adjustments an exercise in patience.  Thanks again everyone!</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments.  This was my first entry ever so I am very pleased with the rating.  There were several reasons, both creative and technical, for the somewhat unconvential crop and after several revision settled on this one.  I knew this would get mixed reactions but I''m glad some people liked it.  I would have like to make some changes to the lighting and positioning of my face but unfortunately I couldn''t devote all day to this image so I had to go with the best one I had at the time.  My setup was rather crude which made attempting to make fine adjustments an exercise in patience.  Thanks again everyone!', '2006-11-12 01:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3023166, 422322, 18450, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deserved blue Elvi!!!</td>', 'Congrats on your well deserved blue Elvi!!!', '2006-11-12 01:38:41.000000', NULL, 0);
