(3023501, 422455, 12611, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great; this a real was  standout for me; the chandolier is fascinating and draws your eyes up, perhaps splitting the composition too much for some people. If you cropped it halfway between the windows, you would have been "better accepted", and the composition would be improved, but the tone would suffer and the bright light would not be there, with all its interest. I love the shot despite my random, rambling criticism.</td>', 'Absolutely great; this a real was  standout for me; the chandolier is fascinating and draws your eyes up, perhaps splitting the composition too much for some people. If you cropped it halfway between the windows, you would have been "better accepted", and the composition would be improved, but the tone would suffer and the bright light would not be there, with all its interest. I love the shot despite my random, rambling criticism.', '2006-11-12 08:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
