(3023874, 422512, 66384, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like this much when I was speeding through the whole lot voting, probably because of the grain. But on second viewing, I find a lot about it that I like very much: the colors with the pink reflecting on your face and collar; the large sky, which at first seemed like negative space, actually adds to the appeal of the image and composition. Sorry about my vote, I definitely under-rated this image.</td>', 'I didn''t like this much when I was speeding through the whole lot voting, probably because of the grain. But on second viewing, I find a lot about it that I like very much: the colors with the pink reflecting on your face and collar; the large sky, which at first seemed like negative space, actually adds to the appeal of the image and composition. Sorry about my vote, I definitely under-rated this image.', '2006-11-12 13:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
