(3024464, 422710, 32997, '<td valign="top">this is a fairly funny self portrait...<br/>because essentially you look like a model who doesn''t want to be there...probably the cold or the light or the wind or maybe tneeding to go to the bathroom...or perhaps standing there thinking "I wonder what this will score?"-ya that would be you-insert smiling face here...now me, I didn''t even consider submitting or voting on this challenge...had a nice coffee upon getting back from my son''s hockey, relaxed to some Van Morrison while playing games, played a bit on the computer, had some friends over, drank a few beers, thought about this challenge hoping Arti-Elvi would win...got up...<br/>sorry didn''t mean to be quite so obnoxious...<br/>maybe I should have written...<br/>"nice"</td>', 'this is a fairly funny self portrait...because essentially you look like a model who doesn''t want to be there...probably the cold or the light or the wind or maybe tneeding to go to the bathroom...or perhaps standing there thinking "I wonder what this will score?"-ya that would be you-insert smiling face here...now me, I didn''t even consider submitting or voting on this challenge...had a nice coffee upon getting back from my son''s hockey, relaxed to some Van Morrison while playing games, played a bit on the computer, had some friends over, drank a few beers, thought about this challenge hoping Arti-Elvi would win...got up...sorry didn''t mean to be quite so obnoxious...maybe I should have written..."nice"', '2006-11-12 20:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
