(3024646, 422494, 37334, '<td valign="top">OkIm typing this from my local police station in Pattaya. I awoke this morning to find to my horror that Djabordjabor  did not get the blue. True to my word I braced myself to run naked down my road. To cut a long story short, I left in my wake a trail of traumatised people. Including one security guard who had to be heavily sedated and will be off work for months.  His colleague managed to call the police in between  his dry heaves. Bad timing on my part, as I had nearly made it back to the safety of my house when the officer nabbed me. <br/> <br/>Im waiting for a lawyer but Ive been told nobody wants to represent me, having seen the video evidence the police shot, no one has the stomach for it.<br/> <br/>Can someone call Amnesty International for me?<br/></td>', 'OkIm typing this from my local police station in Pattaya. I awoke this morning to find to my horror that Djabordjabor  did not get the blue. True to my word I braced myself to run naked down my road. To cut a long story short, I left in my wake a trail of traumatised people. Including one security guard who had to be heavily sedated and will be off work for months.  His colleague managed to call the police in between  his dry heaves. Bad timing on my part, as I had nearly made it back to the safety of my house when the officer nabbed me.  Im waiting for a lawyer but Ive been told nobody wants to represent me, having seen the video evidence the police shot, no one has the stomach for it. Can someone call Amnesty International for me?', '2006-11-12 22:20:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3024719, 422502, 714, '<td valign="top">Honestly this was my favorite shot of the whole bunch.  I had no idea this was you.  You are beautiful and I love that you weren''t afraid to show yourself to us all as you did!  So many people (including myself) expect to see beauty that comes from a front page magazine, but how many of us out there look like that? Beauty comes from the eye of the beholder and to me you are beautiful!</td>', 'Honestly this was my favorite shot of the whole bunch.  I had no idea this was you.  You are beautiful and I love that you weren''t afraid to show yourself to us all as you did!  So many people (including myself) expect to see beauty that comes from a front page magazine, but how many of us out there look like that? Beauty comes from the eye of the beholder and to me you are beautiful!', '2006-11-12 22:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3024748, 422351, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi there - I saw that you''re a new member (joined on my birthday, even!) and that you''re new to the whole post-processing game. This photo is very sweet, as others have said. I think you''re off to a great start! You will learn so much here, and I''m looking forward to seeing where you go from here.</td>', 'Hi there - I saw that you''re a new member (joined on my birthday, even!) and that you''re new to the whole post-processing game. This photo is very sweet, as others have said. I think you''re off to a great start! You will learn so much here, and I''m looking forward to seeing where you go from here.', '2006-11-12 23:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
