(3040426, 422322, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  Congrats on your blue.  I was just wondering.  I love what you did with the colors and I see that you mention that you cross processed it.  Is that what gave it the cool colors and how do you do that?  I''d appreciate any info.  Thanks.</td>', 'This is a great image.  Congrats on your blue.  I was just wondering.  I love what you did with the colors and I see that you mention that you cross processed it.  Is that what gave it the cool colors and how do you do that?  I''d appreciate any info.  Thanks.', '2006-11-17 14:52:02.000000', NULL, 0),
