(3393987, 422606, 24613, '<td valign="top">I came to your profile when I read your forum request to fix the baby''s photo (a noble request indeed - sorry I have VERY little Photoshop knowledge).  Anyway,  you got ripped-off on this one.  Of course since "advanced editing" was the rules, people wanted to see the dramatic.  And a photo with a doorway behind you - Lions and tigers and bears - O'' my!!  We''re all going to die! I like photos that look like I took a photo during life!!  (There are doorways in life, correct?)  The expression on your face is GREAT.  It says, "I''m not sure if I want to do this - well maybe - then again..."  You didn''t use Photoshop to make your eyes "pop" out of the photo - good for you.  They''re beautiful the way they are.  Cropping so the top and bottom is missing REALLY works well here and the door way gives the photo a feeling of "home".  You did an excellent job on this and I love straight from the camera work.  I can''t wait to see what you''ll have instore for us next!!  Take care of yourself. :)  Ray</td>', 'I came to your profile when I read your forum request to fix the baby''s photo (a noble request indeed - sorry I have VERY little Photoshop knowledge).  Anyway,  you got ripped-off on this one.  Of course since "advanced editing" was the rules, people wanted to see the dramatic.  And a photo with a doorway behind you - Lions and tigers and bears - O'' my!!  We''re all going to die! I like photos that look like I took a photo during life!!  (There are doorways in life, correct?)  The expression on your face is GREAT.  It says, "I''m not sure if I want to do this - well maybe - then again..."  You didn''t use Photoshop to make your eyes "pop" out of the photo - good for you.  They''re beautiful the way they are.  Cropping so the top and bottom is missing REALLY works well here and the door way gives the photo a feeling of "home".  You did an excellent job on this and I love straight from the camera work.  I can''t wait to see what you''ll have instore for us next!!  Take care of yourself. :)  Ray', '2007-02-22 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
